# Endpoint the "Book a consultation" form POSTs leads to (JSON body).
# Production builds default to the backend's lead-capture route
# (https://api.buildpanda.io/leads/consultation), which emails the lead to
# the team inbox (LEADS_NOTIFY_EMAIL on the backend). Leave unset in
# development — submissions are logged to the console instead.
NEXT_PUBLIC_LEADS_ENDPOINT=
